# Keep shell scripts LF-only.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true (the default on Windows) a checkout rewrites the
# tracked *.sh files to CRLF. Bash then fails with "$'\r': command not found",
# which is what happens when install.sh / update.sh are run inside WSL.
#
# The blobs in this repository are already LF, so this only changes how they
# are checked out.
*.sh text eol=lf
